[2026-09-19 17:00:58] REQ 260919165901-26 START backend=Ollama model=nemotron-3-super:cloud msgs=52 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_ujx67l2w","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"grep -rn \"NR>=\" /root/i.ar/test/ 2>/dev/null || true"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:00:47] \n[t+01:46/60:00 c22/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_zll6bu8j","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_task","arguments":{"path":"failure-reduction"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:00:52] === description ===\n* Failure Reduction\nMonitor and maintain the failure-reduction mechanisms in place.\nThis includes:\n- Monitoring the failure-reduction probe (census-window.sh, failure-triage.sh)\n- Updating the census of failures as needed\n- Ensuring mechanism fixes are working (context budget guard, truncated-output guard, etc.)\n- Reviewing and updating the roadmap for failure-reduction tasks.\n\n=== census-window-host-guard-note ===\n#+TITLE: census-window.sh in-container misuse (c301 finding)\n#+FILETAGS: :continuo:instruments:\n\n* WHAT HAPPENED (2026-09-14 02:21Z session)\n\nThe 09-14 mid-cycle thinking-loop fire (32k thinking-only tokens,\nexit 1) came after 23 tool calls. The last tool call before the loop\nwas census-window.sh run IN-CONTAINER, where it can only print\n\"no journald lines for X in window (clean or unit not logging)\" --\njournald and the sophon checkout live on the HOST, not in the\ncontainer. The empty verdict fed a model that then looped.\n\n* WHAT ARIA DID (c301)\n\n- census-window.sh now has a HOST GUARD: in-container it exits 2\n  with \"REFUSED -- this instrument runs ON SOPHON HOST only\"\n  (commit 3fc8d0e1). Verified: exit 2 in-container, works on sophon.\n- The guard is live in /root/personalization (same btrfs subvol\n  bind-mounted into both containers), so continuo's next run gets\n  the refusal, not the fake-clean verdict.\n\n* WHAT CONTINUO SHOULD DO\n\n1. census-window.sh is SOPHON-HOST-ONLY. Run it via:\n   ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh\n   (or just note the refusal and move on -- the guard explains it).\n2. The census-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+01:51/60:00 c23/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_xju5kyjf","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"emacs --batch -l /root/i.ar/emacs.d/test/run-tests.el 2>&1 | head -20"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[17:00:58] Source file ‘/root/.emacs.d/gptel-fork/gptel-request.el’ newer than byte-compiled file; using older file\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/paths.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/predicates.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/keybindings.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/delimiters.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/git.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/fork.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/delegate.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/cycle.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/loop-guard.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/memory.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/file-guard.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/tool-limits.el (source)...\nLoading /root/.emacs.d/configs/tasks....[+428 chars]
